  "id": "crisis-team",
  "term": "crisis team",
  "definition": "A crisis team is a type of mental health crisis service that people may use when they are in acute emotional distress and need urgent help. In this context, it refers to services such as crisis or home treatment teams that provide support during a mental health crisis.",
